<title>USA: Barnett Inc to acquire Waxman unit.</title>
<headline>Barnett Inc to acquire Waxman unit.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE. FLA. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnett Inc said Wednesday that it has an agreement in principle to acquire all the assets of LeRan Gas Products, a unit of Waxman Industries Inc for $4.0 million.</p>
<p>LeRan,a direct marketer of products to the liquid propane gas industry, has estimated revenues of $8.0 million this year, Barnett said.</p>
</text>
